<div class="page-header">
  <div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Metas de Estudo</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Defina e acompanhe suas metas diarias e semanais</p>
  </div>
</div>

<% if (locals.success && success) { %>
  <div class="alert alert--success">Metas atualizadas com sucesso.</div>
<% } %>
<% if (locals.error && error) { %>
  <div class="alert alert--danger"><%= error %></div>
<% } %>

<div class="goals-grid">
  <div class="form-card">
    <h2 class="card-title mb-4">Definir Metas</h2>
    <form action="/goals" method="POST" id="goalForm" novalidate>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label" for="dailyHours">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          Meta diaria (horas)
        </label>
        <input class="form-input" type="number" id="dailyHours" name="dailyHours" value="<%= goal ? goal.dailyHours : 4 %>" min="0.5" max="24" step="0.5" required>
        <p class="form-hint">Quantas horas voce quer estudar por dia?</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label" for="weeklyHours">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
          Meta semanal (horas)
        </label>
        <input class="form-input" type="number" id="weeklyHours" name="weeklyHours" value="<%= goal ? goal.weeklyHours : 20 %>" min="1" max="168" step="0.5" required>
        <p class="form-hint">Quantas horas por semana voce quer atingir?</p>
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Salvar Metas</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="card mb-4">
      <h2 class="card-title mb-4">Por que definir metas?</h2>
      <div class="goal-tip">
        <div class="goal-tip-icon" style="color:var(--accent);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="goal-tip-title">Consistencia e a chave</div>
          <p class="goal-tip-text">Estudar regularmente, mesmo por menos tempo, e mais eficaz do que longas sessoes esporadicas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="goal-tip">
        <div class="goal-tip-icon" style="color:var(--teal);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="goal-tip-title">Acompanhe seu progresso</div>
          <p class="goal-tip-text">Com metas definidas, o dashboard mostra quanto falta para voce atingir sua meta do dia e da semana.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="goal-tip">
        <div class="goal-tip-icon" style="color:var(--orange);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/><path d="M4 22h16"/><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/><path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/><path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="goal-tip-title">Referencia para concursos</div>
          <p class="goal-tip-text">Para concursos de alta concorrencia, costuma fazer sentido mirar entre 6 e 10 horas diarias de estudo focado.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2 class="card-title mb-3">Sugestoes de meta</h2>
      <div class="goal-presets">
        <button class="goal-preset" type="button" onclick="setGoal(2, 10)">
          <div class="goal-preset-name">Iniciante</div>
          <div class="goal-preset-value">2h/dia - 10h/semana</div>
        </button>
        <button class="goal-preset" type="button" onclick="setGoal(4, 20)">
          <div class="goal-preset-name">Intermediario</div>
          <div class="goal-preset-value">4h/dia - 20h/semana</div>
        </button>
        <button class="goal-preset" type="button" onclick="setGoal(8, 40)">
          <div class="goal-preset-name">Intensivo</div>
          <div class="goal-preset-value">8h/dia - 40h/semana</div>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
